# Pinned sources. Hashes match the sha256 Homebrew's formula API independently
# records for the same URLs (formulae.brew.sh/api/formula/{ffmpeg,libvpx}.json);
# neither project publishes a checksum file, and FFmpeg's .asc signature needs
# gpg, which this machine does not have (see README).
